[{ "action": "append", "id": "event-modals", "value" : "<div tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"modal-0833e9c2-85c0-4e41-ae7f-0f7ea0c4e93c\" class=\"modal\"><div class=\"modal-dialog modal-lg\"><div class=\"modal-content\"><div class=\"modal-header\"><a data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"close\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span></a><p class=\"text-muted\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-road\"></span> Research Papers</p><strong>Tue 13 Oct 2026 11:30 - 11:45 at <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/room/ase-2026/ase-2026-venue1-forum-7\" class=\"room-link navigate\">Forum 7</a></strong> - <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/track/ase-2026/ase-2026-research-track#program\" class=\"navigate\">Testing and Analysis: Regression and Model-Based Testing 1</a> <small>Chair(s): <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/ase-2026/aldeidaaleti\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\">Aldeida Aleti</a></small></div><div class=\"modal-body\"><div class=\"bg-primary event-title\"><h4><span data-event-star=\"0833e9c2-85c0-4e41-ae7f-0f7ea0c4e93c\" title=\"Add event to your program\"><span class=\"text-disabled glyphicon glyphicon-star-empty\"></span></span><strong>RustGTC: Constraint-Guided Test Generation for Rust APIs via Comment Analysis and Code Context</strong></h4></div><div class=\"bg-info event-description\"><p>Manually crafting test cases for Rust APIs is labor-intensive and error-prone, especially because of Rust\u2019s advanced features and complex trait system. Recent advances in large language models (LLMs) have shown promise in automated test generation; however, existing approaches often underuse documented input requirements embedded in API comments. We present RustGTC, a framework that uses API comments to guide Rust API test generation. RustGTC extracts documented parameter constraints from comments, constructs tests around boundary cases, and repairs generated tests to improve compilability. We evaluate RustGTC on 12 Rust crates, achieving high coverage and uncovering 41 defects. Additionally, we submitted 132 test cases; 123 were accepted, 9 were rejected. These results show that RustGTC uses documented constraints to guide Rust API test generation and reveal comment-code inconsistencies around boundary cases.</p>\n<p></p><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1145/3832783.3837531\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"publication-link navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-link\"></span> DOI</a><p></p><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/ase-2026/yichizhang\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Yichi Zhang<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Peking University</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/ase-2026/jinhaohuang\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Jinhao Huang<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Institute of Software at Chinese Academy of Sciences</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/ase-2026/yangfeng\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Yang Feng\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/yangfeng/1618b733-9e8e-4a3e-95ad-7c0e1fd879eb/micro-avatar?1793538908000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Yang Feng<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Nanjing University</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div><br></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/ase-2026/ase-2026-research-track/235/RustGTC-Constraint-Guided-Test-Generation-for-Rust-APIs-via-Comment-Analysis-and-Cod\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-0833e9c2-85c0-4e41-ae7f-0f7ea0c4e93c').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
